{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgS6EwGRp5jcG3LhRxbGV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The cache split is in place, but I couldn't confirm it works against the live API. The static block may be under the model's minimum cacheable length, which would make the fix a no-op.\n\n**What changed**\n\n- `bot.py`, `build_system()`: the system prompt is now two text blocks, each with an ephemeral `cache_control` marker. Block 1 is the constant `INSTRUCTIONS`. Block 2 is the per-athlete context (date, profile, zones, goal, facts, language). A `save_fact` write now changes only block 2.\n- `README.md`: the caching paragraph described the old single marker, so I updated it.\n- `ANSWER.md`: the write-up you asked for. It covers the cause (confirmed in `logs/usage.jsonl`), the change, which parts of the colleague's note applied, and the open risk.\n\nI checked offline that block 1 is identical across two athletes, two days and an added fact, and that block 2 changes. I didn't commit anything.\n\n**Open risk**\n\nBlock 1 plus the core tool schemas is probably about 750–900 tokens. To my knowledge the minimum for Sonnet-class models is 1024, so the marker may be silently ignored and a memory write would still re-cache everything. I have no API key here, so I couldn't test it. The check is `messages.count_tokens` on the static part, or the first real `save_fact` after deploy: `cache_creation` should be about the tail size, not the full prompt.\n\n**Other issue, not changed**\n\nThe keyword-filtered tool groups (`plan_week`, `predict_race`) change the tools array, which sits above the system prompt in the cache prefix. That means a message that adds a group still misses the cache. The `save_fact` fix doesn't address this. Fixing it would mean giving up the keyword-filter saving, so I left it for you to decide."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2239,"cache_read_input_tokens":38344,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2239},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b831005c-a444-4830-bc83-e9ddc7a71969","uuid":"acc6ef40-a001-44f3-911b-ecf409620ed4","timestamp":"2026-10-27T04:13:31.521Z","request_id":"req_011CgS6EvyKYghSSKV25QReY"}
